# ==========================================================================
# .dockerignore — for SOURCE builds (Coolify / Nixpacks)
# ==========================================================================
#
# Coolify builds this repo with Nixpacks: the generated Dockerfile copies the
# whole checkout (including its own `.nixpacks/` plan) into the image and runs
# `npm ci` + `npm run build` there. So this file only keeps out what must
# never be in a source build: installed or built output from a laptop,
# secrets, and runtime state that lives on persistent volumes.
#
# The runtime-only image (build on the host, package the result) has its own
# whitelist in Dockerfile.runtime.dockerignore — BuildKit uses it
# automatically for `docker build -f Dockerfile.runtime`. Do NOT copy that
# whitelist here: it strips `.nixpacks/` and the source, which is exactly the
# "nixpkgs-….nix: not found" failure of the first Coolify deploy.

node_modules
.next
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
media
private
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
